 "description": "1U horizontal cable manager, FS SKU #317013: a flat black SPCC steel panel on the rack rails with five polycarbonate frames clipped into it and a detachable cover over their fronts, which closes an 80 mm channel across the rack. Each frame is open at the front in a slit between its turned-in ends, and four obround windows in the panel lead cables through to the back.",
